     "type": "text",
     "text": "moving to SF aug 8. found a sublet on craigslist, 1br in inner sunset, $1,650/mo, \"owner is abroad, will mail keys after deposit via zelle\", photos look nice. too good to be true right?",
     "citations": []
    }
   ],
   "sender": "human",
   "index": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-07-16T02:30:00.000000Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-16T02:30:00.000000Z",
