     "stop_timestamp": "2026-07-16T02:32:14.519000Z",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "That confirms it. Don't reply further. You can flag the post on Craigslist so it's removed. For the move, legit options people use for short-term SF stays: furnished sublets from people you can meet or video-call, university-affiliated housing boards, or temporary corporate housing for a few weeks while you look in person.",
     "citations": []
    }
   ],
