     "stop_timestamp": "2026-07-16T02:33:50.580000Z",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Then you can take your time: being in SF lets you view places in person, which removes most of the scam risk. Sublets from people who are leaving for a few months often show up in neighborhood Facebook groups and local Slack/Discord communities; meeting the current tenant is the best check.",
     "citations": []
